        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for bcel",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for bcel fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-94114: Apache Commons BCEL: Nested Code/Record attributes drive unbounded parse-time recursion in ClassParser\n  (bsc#1284400).\n- CVE-2026-105111: Apache Commons BCEL: Class2HTML emits unescaped class strings, enabling stored XSS (bsc#1284399).\n\nChanges for bcel:\n\n- Updated to version 6.13.0.\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
