    {
      "cve": "CVE-2026-94114",
      "ids": [
        {
          "system_name": "SUSE CVE Page",
          "text": "https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-94114"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "Symbolic name not mapping to correct class.\n\n\n\nBCEL caches attacker-controlled classes under their self-declared names without validating the requested name, allowing subsequent lookups and name-keyed verification results to refer to a different class.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Commons BCEL: before 6.13.0.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 6.13.0, which fixes the issue.",
          "title": "CVE description"
        }
      ],
